## Notes

- Nested submodule: andesim_abi appears twice (andesim/include and
  andesim/verilator/external/andesim_abi). Both pin the SAME commit; keep them in
  step when the ABI changes (bump abi -> bump in verilator -> bump verilator in
  andesim).
- `scripts/build_vsim.sh` currently mounts `$ROOT/include:/include:ro` so the
  container's `/work/../include` resolves. After F3 that mount is dead code.
- Staged F1 content lives in the session scratchpad until the URL arrives.
- verilator base decision (F3/F4): the submodule had two divergent lines --
  `andesim`/origin (0cf66d5) and `feature-backup` (3d926fe, the commit andesim
  recorded). Chose to keep the `andesim` line. Content is identical for the
  hybrid transport code; `feature-backup` only additionally carries
